Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.24,0:00:04.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}欢迎收看《永恒》。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Welcome to "Everlasting."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.30,0:00:07.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}切特·威尔顿……《永恒》的创始人……大人物。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chet Wilton... creator of "Everlasting"... big kahuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.71,0:00:09.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真走运，你那个小把戏\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're very lucky that your little stunt
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.71,0:00:11.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上一季给我带来了超高收视率。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}got me boo-yah ratings last season.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.54,0:00:13.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，杰里米，我很抱歉，我，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, Jeremy, I'm sorry that I, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.85,0:00:15.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是说你一声不吭就消失了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That you disappeared without saying a word?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.65,0:00:17.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看到你和莉齐复合了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Saw that you and Lizzie got back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.45,0:00:20.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她是我未婚妻。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's my fiancée.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.12,0:00:21.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我打过电话，瑞秋。是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I called, Rach. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.76,0:00:23.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}玛丽。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.39,0:00:25.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是那个又老……又老又绝望的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm the old... Old, desperate one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.13,0:00:26.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她丈夫对她家暴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Her husband was physically abusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.73,0:00:28.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还打孩子，把她胳膊打断了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hit the kid, too, broke her arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.43,0:00:30.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们需要你做的是谈谈你还是处女这件事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, what we need you to do is talk about being a virgin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.73,0:00:32.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.60,0:00:34.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得我有点高攀不上了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think I'm a little out of my league.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.50,0:00:35.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在开玩笑吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.87,0:00:38.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是这里最有魅力的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're the most attractive person here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.21,0:00:40.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}切特从我们俩手里偷走了《永恒》。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chet stole "Everlasting" from both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.77,0:00:42.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这只是你和他的各执一词。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's your word against his.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.34,0:00:45.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除非你能找到你最初的样书。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, unless you were to find your original look book.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.35,0:00:48.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你夺走了我的一切。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have taken everything from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.75,0:00:50.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不会再这样了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.62,0:00:53.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有些人觉得这很老派\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Some people think it's old-fashioned
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.49,0:00:55.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}向女方家人提亲。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to ask a girl's family for her hand in marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.82,0:01:00.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但在《永恒》，骑士精神没有消亡。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But here at "Everlasting," chivalry is not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.17,0:01:06.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}*啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦*\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* La, la, la, la, la, la, la, la *
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.72,0:01:24.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，本着真正求爱的精神，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, in the spirit of true courtship,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.45,0:01:27.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亚当这周将和一位幸运女士一起回家\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Adam will be going home with one lucky lady this week
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.39,0:01:28.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去见她的家人，希望能\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to meet her family in hopes
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.69,0:01:30.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把他们的关系推向下一阶段。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}of taking their relationship to the next level.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.86,0:01:32.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亚当。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.36,0:01:33.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}女士们，我希望我能跟\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ladies, I wish I could go home
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.69,0:01:35.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们每一个人回家。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with each and every one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.26,0:01:37.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是，呃，不，说真的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But, um no, seriously,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.80,0:01:40.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我，呃……我打算迈出这重要的一步\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I, um... I plan on taking this serious step
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.33,0:01:42.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和一个我还不太了解的人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with someone who I haven't got to know very well
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.87,0:01:45.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但她绝对激起了我的好奇心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but who has definitely piqued my curiosity.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.84,0:01:47.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}费丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.48,0:01:49.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.44,0:01:51.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.88,0:01:55.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干得漂亮，女士。你怎么让他选了费丝？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nice job, lady. How did you get him to pick Faith?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.22,0:01:57.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，这简直是幼儿级别的逆反心理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, that's some toddler-level reverse psychology.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.18,0:01:59.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，我让他淘汰费丝，结果他就选了她。哎呀。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I told him to cut Faith, and so he picked her. Aww.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.75,0:02:02.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁知道马脸妹会成为观众最爱？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, who knew horse-face was gonna be a crowd favorite?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.76,0:02:07.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我们就给他们来点硬核美国风。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So let's give them some hard-core Americana.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.50,0:02:08.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们在做什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are we doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.93,0:02:11.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，我在想一个温馨的小型迷你牛仔竞技\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, so I was thinking about a sweet, little mini rodeo
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.90,0:02:13.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}接着来一场教堂舞会……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}followed up by a church dance...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.43,0:02:15.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇，哇，哇。你太卖力了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whoa, whoa, whoa. You're working way too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.27,0:02:17.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去他的牛仔竞技，直接让你的“汪汪”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Screw the rodeo and just get your "woof woof"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.24,0:02:18.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟那个大块头破处。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to lose it to the big guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.31,0:02:19.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，但她甚至还没承认\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, but she hasn't even admitted
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.64,0:02:20.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}自己是处女，所以……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that she's a virgin yet, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.87,0:02:23.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就让她承认。拜托，小金。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, then get her to. Come on, Goldy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.81,0:02:27.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要是在迪克西帮她破了处，就给你减一万债务。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's 10k off your debt if you can pop her cherry in Dixie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.98,0:02:29.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.87,0:02:51.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在你们其余女士要录制视频邀请\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now the rest of you ladies will be making video invitations
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.64,0:02:53.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}向亚当解释\N{\rEN\blur0.8}explaining to Adam
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.31,0:02:55.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么你们想让他见你们的家人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}why you would like him to meet your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.44,0:02:59.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃。玛丽就是个带着诡异笑容的机器人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ugh. Mary's a freaking robot with that creepy smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.25,0:03:00.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很惊讶她还能感觉到什么\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm surprised she can feel anything
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.81,0:03:02.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}吃了那么多情绪稳定剂。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with all the mood stabilizers she's on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.65,0:03:06.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她有躁郁症，还因为家暴患上了创伤后应激障碍。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's bipolar, and she has PTSD from the domestic abuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.89,0:03:08.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我能看看那个吗？可以。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can I see that? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.96,0:03:12.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，希亚，今天我需要你全力负责那些视频邀请。好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, Shia, I need you all over those video invitations today. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.76,0:03:14.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋不在的时候，我可以负责她的女孩们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can cover Rachel's girls while she's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.70,0:03:15.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不会太忙吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're not gonna be too busy
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.00,0:03:17.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}忙着把你的整个脑袋塞进切特的屁股里？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}trying to get your entire head up Chet's asshole?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.63,0:03:20.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不会。我天生擅长多任务处理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nah. I'm a born multi-tasker.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.77,0:03:24.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，大家动起来！瑞秋？说句话？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, let's go, people! Rachel? A word?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.04,0:03:25.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，呃，我担心你，亲爱的。为什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, uh, I'm worried about you, hon. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.84,0:03:27.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为你要去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, you're about to go
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.38,0:03:28.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和杰里米第一次过夜旅行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}on your first overnight trip with Jeremy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.01,0:03:31.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。是啊，我——我会没事的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right. Yeah, I-I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.28,0:03:33.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我——我只是想让你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen, I-I-I just want you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.51,0:03:36.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}继续为自己做出正确的决定。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to keep making good decisions for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.05,0:03:38.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}尤其是向他妥协，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Giving into him, in particular,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.32,0:03:40.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上次让你有点失控。墨西哥？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}kind of destabilized you last time. Mexico?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.39,0:03:41.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我记得。是啊，我记得。我明白。我知道了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I remember. Yeah, I remember. I understand. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.92,0:03:44.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还——还有，如果你在路上能别碰酒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A-And if you could stay away from the booze on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.59,0:03:46.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}会让我们欲火焚身。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Makes us horny.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.59,0:03:48.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}知道了。谢谢！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Got it. Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.93,0:03:50.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想跟我解释一下为什么你做了相反的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want to walk me through why you did the opposite
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.00,0:03:52.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我让你做的事吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}of what I asked you to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.37,0:03:53.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我不是你的提线木偶。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because I'm not your meat puppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.60,0:03:55.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇。这会是个有趣的周末。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wow. It's gonna be a fun weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.80,0:03:59.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}尽量别全程跟你男朋友吵架，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Try not to fight with your boyfriend the whole time, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.37,0:04:01.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亚当。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.41,0:04:02.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.74,0:04:03.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实还有一件事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There is actually one more thing
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.98,0:04:05.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这周我可能会请你帮我做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I might ask you to do for me this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.65,0:04:07.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但这个，我发誓绝对合你胃口。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But this one, I swear it's gonna be right up your alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.85,0:04:09.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}合我胃口，真的？是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Up my alley, really? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.45,0:04:10.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就等着……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll just wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.42,0:04:14.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的天！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.56,0:04:15.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我迫不及待想让你看看奶奶的牧场。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I cannot wait for you to see Gran's ranch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.89,0:04:17.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道。我也等不及了。一定会很棒！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know. I can't wait. It's gonna be so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.42,0:04:19.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，大家，暂停一下，大家。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, guys, time out, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.09,0:04:20.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}暂停。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Time out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.03,0:04:22.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在我们去聊聊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now let's go have a conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.43,0:04:23.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回头再跟你说。好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll talk to you later. All right.
