Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.42,0:04:48.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让你们的关系在身体上更进一步。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to let your relationship evolve, you know, in a physical way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.59,0:04:51.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，你知道我不能。不，听我说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, you know I can't. No, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.62,0:04:53.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道这对你来说意义重大，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know that's a really big deal for you, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.49,0:04:55.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是说亚当……他真的是个很棒的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I'm just saying that Adam... He's like a really great guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.80,0:04:58.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对吧，他超级贴心，性感得要命，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right, he's super-sweet, crazy-hot,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.06,0:05:00.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你来这里就是为了尝试新东西，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and that's why you came here, to try new things, right?
