Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.71,0:05:09.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然，亲爱的，别这样。你想多了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course, sweetie, come on. You're crazy.
