Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.71,0:05:14.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是觉得\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm just saying that I think
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.05,0:05:16.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亚当从第一天起就和你很来电，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Adam's been connected to you since day one,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.05,0:05:18.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果我是你，我会想让他，呃，拿走我的第一次。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and if I were you, I'd want him to, uh, take my flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.52,0:05:22.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，亲爱的，回头见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, sweetie, I'll see you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.90,0:05:31.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪！你们好！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my gosh! Hi, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.83,0:05:33.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦！哦！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.60,0:05:35.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.04,0:05:38.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}过来，我的小甜薯，抱抱我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come here, my sweet, little tater, and hug my neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.61,0:05:40.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，外婆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ohh. Hi, Gran.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.44,0:05:41.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.58,0:05:42.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.
