Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.08,0:05:53.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亚当，这是我最好的朋友，艾米。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ooh, Adam, this is my best friend, Amy.
