Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.16,0:05:59.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然，好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sure, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.99,0:06:03.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放松点，好好享受今天，亲爱的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now relax and enjoy the day, sweetheart.
