Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.44,0:06:16.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.88,0:06:18.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我居然还在这儿，真不敢相信。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm shocked that I'm still here.
