Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.76,0:07:13.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们谈完了吗？因为……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are we done? 'Cause...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.67,0:07:14.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，嘿，嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, hey, hey.
