Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.83,0:07:40.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.53,0:07:42.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不然你就在全国电视上被甩\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or you get dumped on national television
