Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.40,0:10:04.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你和Adam到目前为止的肢体关系？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your physical relationship with Adam so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.77,0:10:08.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我和Adam的肢体关系又火热又性感\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My physical relationship with Adam has been hot and sexy
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.17,0:10:11.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且，呃……来这儿的路上他还牵了我的手。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and, um... oh, he held my hand on the way up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.95,0:10:13.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得他那样特别浪漫。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I thought that was very romantic of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.01,0:10:16.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，可你今晚要和他过夜，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, but you are going to be spending the night with him,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.72,0:10:18.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你连亲都还没亲过他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you haven't even kissed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.22,0:10:19.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，这确实有点怪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, that's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.79,0:10:22.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Faith，你好像不太自在。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Faith, you seem uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.26,0:10:23.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有，没有，没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.09,0:10:24.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.92,0:10:26.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.16,0:10:28.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这跟你朋友Amy没关系吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, it doesn't have anything to do with your friend Amy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.76,0:10:30.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你什么意思？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.20,0:10:33.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看见你们俩在前院说话，看起来……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I saw you two talking on the front lawn, and it looked...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.23,0:10:35.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，看起来气氛有点紧张。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, it looked kind of intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.30,0:10:36.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她只是觉得性这种事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She just thinks that sex
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.80,0:10:39.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}根本不该在电视上谈，更别说……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}shouldn't even be talked about on TV, let alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.81,0:10:41.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，是吗？那她觉得该在哪儿谈？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, really? Where does she think it should be discussed?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.71,0:10:44.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是已婚两人的话题，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a subject for two married people
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.98,0:10:48.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且只能在上帝的注视下谈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}under the watchful eye of God only.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.05,0:10:50.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那可就没什么空间去发现自我了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That doesn't leave a lot of room for finding yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.78,0:10:52.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去探索各种不同的选择，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you know, exploring all the different options,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.02,0:10:54.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而这都是成长过程中\N{\rEN\blur0.8}which is a very, very normal part
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.82,0:10:56.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}非常非常正常的一部分，你不觉得吗，Faith？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}of growing up, don't you think, Faith?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.76,0:10:57.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我不觉得。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I don't think that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.99,0:11:00.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实我根本不知道你在说什么，Rachel。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I actually don't even know what you're talking about, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.43,0:11:03.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在我看来，Amy的意见对你真的很重要。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To me, it just seems like Amy's opinion really matters to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.30,0:11:05.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像她是你生命中非常重要的人，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like, she's a very important person in your life,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.77,0:11:06.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许还是最重要的那个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}possibly the most important.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.93,0:11:09.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Rachel，你别说了，真的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, you need to stop, seriously,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.17,0:11:13.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为，呃，我爱上了Adam，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'cause, um, I'm in love with Adam,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.51,0:11:17.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想让他拿走我的初夜……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I want him to take my virginity...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.31,0:11:19.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就在今晚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.09,0:11:29.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个谷仓是你曾祖父建的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, your great-grandfather built this barn?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.22,0:11:31.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}全镇的人一起出力的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The whole town pitched it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.76,0:11:33.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.20,0:11:37.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有，呃……算了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And, uh... screw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.86,0:11:39.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.44,0:11:46.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.94,0:11:50.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.28,0:11:52.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，别这样。那……那感觉很美好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, please. That was... that was lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.78,0:11:54.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.35,0:11:58.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，Adam，呃，事情是这样……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, Adam, uh, the thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.38,0:12:00.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还是处女。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm a virgin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.52,0:12:06.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我希望你能成为我的第一个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I'd like you to be my first.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.49,0:12:11.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，天啊，Faith。这……这真是我的荣幸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, wow, Faith. That is... that's such an honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.96,0:12:14.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这……这确实是吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I-It is, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.80,0:12:17.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的，当然。是啊。呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, of course. Yeah. Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.24,0:12:21.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能稍等我一下吗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can you excuse me
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.24,0:12:23.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就一下？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for just a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.21,0:12:25.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然，好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sure, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.25,0:12:28.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Rachel，你开什么玩笑？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.48,0:12:29.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她的第一次？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Her first?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.85,0:12:30.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就当是夸奖吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take it as a compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.92,0:12:33.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，你经手的全是满意的客户。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, nothing but satisfied customers in your wake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.25,0:12:36.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们到底来这儿干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the hell are we doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.19,0:12:38.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是想上知识产权课，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want lessons in intellectual property,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.03,0:12:40.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还是我们要来场律师小约会？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}or are we having a little lawyer playdate?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.46,0:12:42.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，听起来挺好玩，但不是。我们已经撤了知识产权的案子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ooh, sounds fun, but no. We've thrown out the I.P. case.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.50,0:12:44.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我让我的当事人来说吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll let my client do the honors.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.93,0:12:48.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要起诉同居赡养费、承诺禁反言和欺诈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am suing for palimony, promissory estoppel, and fraud.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.57,0:12:50.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.90,0:12:52.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，你现在是在指控\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, now you're alleging
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.34,0:12:55.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的当事人是我当事人的情妇？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that your client is my client's mistress?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.08,0:12:58.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，更像是长达八年的专一婚外情，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ooh, more like an eight-year-long monogamous affair
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.18,0:13:00.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且许下的承诺至今没有兑现。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with promises made that remain unfulfilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.31,0:13:02.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的当事人因为那些承诺，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My client has turned down job offers
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.22,0:13:04.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拒绝了工作机会和求婚，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and marriage proposals based on said promises
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.48,0:13:07.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在只是要求赔偿，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and is simply claiming recompense
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.05,0:13:09.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}以《永恒》40%股份的形式。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in the form of a 40% stake in "Everlasting."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.49,0:13:12.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，这下好玩了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, this should be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.62,0:13:14.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shouldn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.19,0:13:16.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们有手机记录和信用卡账单，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have cellphone records and credit-card bills,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.00,0:13:19.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}更别提照片了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}not to mention photographs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.47,0:13:24.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那真是太糟了。我该觉得享受吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That really didn't go well. Was I supposed to like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.87,0:13:26.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，Faith。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, Faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.11,0:13:28.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}接吻本来应该感觉很好的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Kissing is supposed to feel really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.28,0:13:29.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等，等等。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.51,0:13:33.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你从来没真正亲过谁吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Have you never kissed anybody for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.31,0:13:35.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，我是说……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.02,0:13:37.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.55,0:13:39.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.09,0:13:40.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我和Amy在夏令营时\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Amy and I sort of practiced
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.15,0:13:41.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拿枕头练过，但……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}on our pillows at camp but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.65,0:13:43.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有彼此？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.16,0:13:44.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.99,0:13:48.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.93,0:13:55.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，Faith，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, well, Faith, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.20,0:13:57.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道。你有没有……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know. Have you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.24,0:13:59.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有没有想过，你和Amy，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Have you ever thought that you and Amy,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.54,0:14:02.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，你也许爱上了Amy？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you know, that you might be in love with Amy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.38,0:14:05.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太恶心了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.18,0:14:06.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，不是的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.58,0:14:08.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这很美。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.22,0:14:10.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇，看来你很喜欢水疗。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wow. Looks like you enjoy spas.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.95,0:14:12.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他也是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As does he.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.92,0:14:15.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们六周前才去峡谷牧场住了四晚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We just went to Canyon Ranch six weeks ago for four nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.49,0:14:19.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些信用卡消费都在你名下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm. And all these credit-card charges are in your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.06,0:14:23.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的，但酒店账单显示有两位客人，还有一次男士面部护理。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, but the hotel folio shows two guests and a male facial.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.53,0:14:25.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那可能是任何男人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm, that could be any man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.60,0:14:27.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但不是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But it wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.23,0:14:29.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我确信威尔顿先生的信用卡账单，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I'm sure that Mr. Wilton's credit-card statements,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.37,0:14:32.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一旦被传票调取，也会显示亚利桑那州图森的消费，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}once subpoenaed, will reflect charges in Tucson, Arizona,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.50,0:14:34.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是那一周。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that week, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.47,0:14:36.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，他其实付现金。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, he actually pays cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.68,0:14:39.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.25,0:14:42.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}基于所有这些……证据，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Based on all of this... evidence,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.95,0:14:45.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我唯一能得出的结论，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the only thing that I can gather
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.22,0:14:47.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是你在跟踪我的当事人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}is you've been stalking my client.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.69,0:14:50.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}得了吧，跟踪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, come on. Stalking?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.26,0:14:52.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们有理由申请限制令，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have grounds for a restraining order,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.26,0:14:58.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只要切特点头，我今天就准备提交。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}which, if Chet gives the word, I'm prepared to file today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.27,0:15:07.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们有过不圣洁的念头……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We've had unholy thoughts...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.67,0:15:10.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但从未付诸行动。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but we've never acted on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.31,0:15:11.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}费丝，你为什么来上电视，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Faith, why did you come on TV
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.64,0:15:13.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你对这种事这么困惑？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}if you were so confused about this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.68,0:15:16.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.15,0:15:17.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我以为我会去好莱坞，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I thought I would go off to Hollywood,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.02,0:15:21.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那里会有一位王子，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and there would be this prince,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.45,0:15:23.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且很有钱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and he'd be rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.29,0:15:28.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后一切……一切都会好起来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And then everything... Everything would be fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.16,0:15:30.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，你不需要被修复。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, listen, you don't need any fixing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.20,0:15:32.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这世上有那么多人，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There is just a whole world of people
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.03,0:15:33.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}正等着爱你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that are just waiting to love you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.60,0:15:35.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和艾米，爱你们本来的样子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and Amy for who you both are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.17,0:15:40.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上帝会因为我爱上一个女人而惩罚我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}God's gonna strike me down for loving a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.04,0:15:44.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的家人会跟我断绝关系，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My family is gonna disown me,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.38,0:15:46.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的教会会把我赶出去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and my church would kick me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.78,0:15:49.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们非得那样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They'd have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.58,0:15:52.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，我有个主意，费丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, well, I have an idea, Faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.18,0:15:53.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有个主意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.25,0:15:54.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你就……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What if you just...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.45,0:15:57.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你就大声说出来一次？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What if you just said it out loud one time?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.32,0:16:00.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看上帝会不会惩罚你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, see if God strikes you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.40,0:16:08.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.50,0:16:10.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我做不到，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't do that, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.30,0:16:11.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧。我做不到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, come on. I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.80,0:16:14.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一直把这些憋在心里是什么感觉？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How does it feel having all of this bottled up all the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.27,0:16:16.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就大声说出来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just say it out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.81,0:16:20.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就一次。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.08,0:16:24.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，费丝，你还好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Faith, you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.28,0:16:26.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，还好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.49,0:16:28.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.16,0:16:32.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，抱歉之前那些亲亲我我的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, sorry about all that kissy-kissy stuff earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.42,0:16:34.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，完全没关系。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh. That's perfectly all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.69,0:16:36.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别担心。对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't worry. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.16,0:16:38.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，亚当，我得告诉你一件事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, Adam, I got to tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.20,0:16:39.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.60,0:16:42.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Actually, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.84,0:16:48.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我对你……没有那种感觉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not... attracted to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.24,0:16:53.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，你对别人有感觉吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, are you attracted to someone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.82,0:16:57.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.75,0:17:02.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实是，对一个人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To one person, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.86,0:17:07.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对我的朋友。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.63,0:17:16.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}艾米。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Amy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.42,0:17:34.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.52,0:17:39.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.69,0:17:42.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ohh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.50,0:17:46.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，嘿，你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.74,0:17:55.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，奎恩，我能跟你谈谈视频邀请的事吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, hey, Quinn, can I talk to you about the video invites?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.47,0:17:58.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋在哪？呃，密西西比，记得吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where is Rachel? Uh, Mississippi, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.34,0:18:00.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎恩，怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.41,0:18:03.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}切特在搞我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chet's screwing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.48,0:18:06.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉，奎恩，但我觉得大家都知道了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry, Quinn, but I kind of feel like everybody knows that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.15,0:18:07.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。不不不不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. No, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.62,0:18:09.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.82,0:18:14.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他想说是我跟踪他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}he's trying to say that I stalked him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.76,0:18:16.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他到底为什么那么说？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why the hell would he say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.33,0:18:19.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我在起诉他。你起诉他什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because I'm suing him. What are you suing him for?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.90,0:18:23.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为是我创造了这个……《永恒》。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because I created this... "Everlasting."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.67,0:18:26.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是你？对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You did? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.21,0:18:29.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，是我的主意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, it was my idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.21,0:18:30.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是我的主意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's my idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.68,0:18:32.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}全是我的！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.51,0:18:33.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哎哟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.88,0:18:36.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈哈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ha ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.55,0:18:39.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们要把我的案子驳回。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They are throwing my case out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.69,0:18:41.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，你为什么要这么较真？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen, why are you taking this so literally?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.95,0:18:43.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是业内最好的制作人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're the best producer in the industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.96,0:18:47.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能让一个幸福的人跳桥。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You could make a perfectly happy person jump off a bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.23,0:18:49.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.56,0:18:52.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，别管律师。去"制作"切特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, screw the lawyers. Produce Chet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.63,0:18:54.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让他跳桥。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Make him jump off a bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.83,0:18:56.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，合法地。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Legally, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.24,0:18:58.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该死。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.21,0:19:02.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说得对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.61,0:19:08.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等……你刚才想说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What, wait... What did you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.38,0:19:09.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，之前。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.45,0:19:10.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，没……没什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, it's... it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.48,0:19:11.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看，是玛丽。我试过了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, it's Mary. I tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.92,0:19:13.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真的深入进去了，但我觉得……哦，玛丽。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I really got in there, but I think... Oh, Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.79,0:19:15.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我来。我去跟她谈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I'll do it. I'll go talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.29,0:19:16.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我去做。我去跟她谈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll go do it. I'll go talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.79,0:19:18.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不不不，Quinn。我不是这个意思……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no, no, Quinn. That's not what I wanted...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.66,0:19:20.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事。我们挺好的。谈得不错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's okay. We're good. Good talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.53,0:19:22.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。嗨。我，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Hi. I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.26,0:19:25.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要你把出柜那段剪掉，然后……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need you to pull out that coming-out bit and...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.33,0:19:26.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Rach，Rach，我做不到。为什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rach, Rach, I can't. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.93,0:19:29.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}新来的后期主管有严重强迫症。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The new post supervisor is crazy OCD.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.54,0:19:30.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可是，我答应过Faith\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, but I promised Faith
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.87,0:19:32.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除非她准备好，否则我们不会播。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that we wouldn't air it unless she was ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.54,0:19:34.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Rach，你做这种事之前得先问我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rach, you got to ask me before you do stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.31,0:19:35.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，我本来可以换张新卡进去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, I could have dropped a new card in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.78,0:19:37.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你本来想拍什么鬼都行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You could have shot whatever the hell you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.54,0:19:38.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，好。呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, okay. Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.91,0:19:41.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们怎么办？能怎么办？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are we gonna do? What can we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.38,0:19:43.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没办法，Rach。你得给家里的人打电话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's nothing to do, Rach. You got to call someone at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.68,0:19:45.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你得让他们截下来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You got to get them to intercept it
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.32,0:19:46.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}登记一下，然后藏起来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and log it and then hide it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.82,0:19:48.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。收到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.39,0:19:53.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，大家好。密西西比怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, hey, y'all. How is Mississippi?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.03,0:19:55.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，你还记得跟父母出柜的时候吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, do you remember coming out to your parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.03,0:19:58.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃。天啊。你干嘛提醒我？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ugh. Oh, God. Why did you remind me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.56,0:20:00.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，我需要你帮我个忙。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I need you to do something for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.64,0:20:11.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Mary。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.31,0:20:12.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.61,0:20:15.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是Quinn。呃，我们还没正式见过，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm Quinn. Uh, we've never officially met,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.38,0:20:18.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过我是这节目的执行制片人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I'm the executive producer of this show.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.32,0:20:19.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我做错什么了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did I do something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.99,0:20:21.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就是想问你个问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just have a question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.92,0:20:23.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.32,0:20:24.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你为什么来这儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.86,0:20:26.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.73,0:20:29.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，你为什么决定来参加这个节目？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, why did you decide to do this show?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.36,0:20:32.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，呃……重新开始，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, um... to start over,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.90,0:20:37.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，走出舒适圈，开阔眼界。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to, um, put myself out there and broaden my horizons.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.00,0:20:40.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得你在这么做吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you feel like you're doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.07,0:20:41.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。是啊，我是说，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Yeah, I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.51,0:20:43.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这绝对在我的舒适圈之外。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}this is definitely out of my comfort zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.74,0:20:46.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看得出来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.04,0:20:48.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧。跟我坐下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. Sit down with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.75,0:20:53.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这让我很难过，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It just makes me so sad,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.08,0:20:58.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我看得出，有什么人或什么事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because I can see that something or someone
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.96,0:21:01.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把你吓坏了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}scared the crap out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.46,0:21:06.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让你害怕自己的力量。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Made you scared of your own power.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.00,0:21:10.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有人吓到你了吗，Mary？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did someone scare you, Mary?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.37,0:21:14.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，也许吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.84,0:21:19.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就把他们钉死在十字架上，一把火烧了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then nail them to the cross and burn it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.85,0:21:22.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明白吗？因为我跟你说……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay? Because let me tell you something...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.58,0:21:24.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个成年女人对另一个成年女人说……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One grown-ass woman to another...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.55,0:21:27.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你绝不会想发现\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You do not want to find yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.65,0:21:30.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}八年之后，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}another eight years down the road,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.12,0:21:35.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}自己从没对真正想要的东西诚实过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}having never been honest about what you really want.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.40,0:21:44.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.57,0:21:47.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要么硬气起来，认真对待，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Either ball-up and give a shit,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.91,0:21:50.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要么现在就收拾行李走人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}or pack your bags right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.74,0:21:52.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}保重。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.76,0:22:05.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说真的，各位，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, honestly, you guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.06,0:22:07.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去他的瓦萨学院毕业、在PBS工作的朋友。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}screw my friends at Vassar working at PBS.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.46,0:22:11.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Faith出柜可能会有1500万人看到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Faith's coming out could be seen by 15 million people.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.76,0:22:13.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这能改变人生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That changes lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.10,0:22:14.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，这就是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, that's the reason
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.60,0:22:16.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我当初想进电视圈的原因。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}why I wanted to get into TV in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.94,0:22:18.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，这是个巨大的平台。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, it's a huge, huge platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.84,0:22:20.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想，如果我人生中这疯狂的一章\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I suppose I wouldn't mind if this crazy chapter in my life
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.67,0:22:22.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能为人类做点好事，我也不介意。对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}did something good for the human race. I mean, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.68,0:22:24.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-对吧？  -你们啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Right?   -You guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.44,0:22:25.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是吗？嗨！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah? Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.41,0:22:26.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.18,0:22:28.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一直在为此祈祷。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've been praying on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.88,0:22:30.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不想再抗拒了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't want to fight it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.82,0:22:31.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爱上Amy了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm in love with Amy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.98,0:22:33.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想退出节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want to quit the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.72,0:22:37.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇，Faith。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wow, Faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.62,0:22:39.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那会……你跟Amy谈过了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That will... well, have you talked to Amy yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.86,0:22:42.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谈过了。她也在为此祈祷。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. She's praying on it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.63,0:22:45.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要……要祈祷的事很多。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's a... There's a lot to pray on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.86,0:22:47.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上帝的恩典在我心中，Rachel。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}God's grace is in me, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.90,0:22:48.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我能感觉到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.87,0:22:50.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。天啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Oh, my gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.60,0:22:53.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我全身都起上帝的鸡皮疙瘩了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's just giving me God bumps all over me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.74,0:22:55.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看我的胳膊！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look at my arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.17,0:22:57.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我明天还想再做一次。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want to do it again tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.74,0:22:59.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在……在教堂舞会上。我想作见证。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A-at the church dance. I want to testify.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.01,0:23:02.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，Faith，不，听着，那是很大的一步。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, Faith, no, listen, that's a huge step.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.15,0:23:03.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的教友需要知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My congregation needs to know
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.72,0:23:05.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上帝珍爱他所有的孩子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that God cherishes all his children.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.88,0:23:07.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，当然，当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, of course, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.15,0:23:09.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可你跟奶奶谈过了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But have you talked to your Gran yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.49,0:23:12.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Rachel，你看，如果奶奶能看到有一个人……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, look, if Gran can see that one person...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.12,0:23:13.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你或者你们……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You or you guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.16,0:23:15.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能接受我，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can accept me,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.06,0:23:17.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果她看到我能有朋友\N{\rEN\blur0.8}if she can see that I can have friends
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.03,0:23:19.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能有爱，这会缓和冲击。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I can have love, it's gonna soften the blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.47,0:23:21.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不觉得吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.93,0:23:23.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，好吧。我们就……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, all right. Let's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.54,0:23:25.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们就把这个乡下小镇狠狠\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's just kick this hillbilly town's ass
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.17,0:23:27.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}踢进新千年！干不干？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}into the new millennium! Should we do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.07,0:23:28.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好！这才是我想说的！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah! This is what I'm talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.91,0:23:30.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，我看看能不能弄到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, I'll see if I can find
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.24,0:23:32.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一些额外的奖金，给你和Amy\N{\rEN\blur0.8}some extra, you know, bonus money for you and Amy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.54,0:23:35.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样你们就能搬去更包容的地方。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so you guys can move someplace a little bit more accepting.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.11,0:23:36.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？不，我不搬。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? No, I'm not moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.78,0:23:38.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是我的家。我就住这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is my home. This is where I live.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.85,0:23:42.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要留下来，让他们都相信。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna stay here and make them all believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.17,0:24:00.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只想在死前看到她结婚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just want to see her married before I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.91,0:24:04.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你、你不觉得亚当是个好小伙子吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}D-don't you think that Adam is a nice young boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.84,0:24:06.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，当然。绝对。他是个好人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yeah. Absolutely. He's a great guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.01,0:24:09.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}用我妈的话说，是个“真正的好人”。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Real mensch," as my mother would say.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.25,0:24:12.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奶奶？能让我们单独待一会儿吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Gran? Uh, would you excuse us for just a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.92,0:24:14.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，好的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yes. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.25,0:24:15.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，我马上回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh. I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.92,0:24:18.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。等一下。怎么了，亲爱的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks. One sec. What's up, sweetie?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.66,0:24:21.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.69,0:24:22.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道你做了什么\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know what you did
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.90,0:24:24.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把费丝的脑子搞乱了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to get Faith's head all screwed up,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.10,0:24:25.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但她现在脑子不正常。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but she is not in her right mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.73,0:24:27.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听我说，艾米，她告诉你了吗……对，她告诉我了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen, Amy, did she tell you... Yeah. She told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.13,0:24:28.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她也许准备好了，但我没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She might be ready, but I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.70,0:24:30.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是主日学校老师。我知道，我知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm a Sunday School teacher. I know. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.94,0:24:32.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但艾米，我向你保证……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But Amy, I promise you...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.24,0:24:34.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我保证世界真的变了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I promise you the world has really changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.07,0:24:35.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，在好莱坞。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, in Hollywood.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.61,0:24:37.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道他们怎么对待……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know what they do to...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.28,0:24:38.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这里的同性恋吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}gay people around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.91,0:24:41.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}马修·谢泼德的事听说过吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Does Matthew Shepard ring a bell?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.02,0:24:45.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊！天哪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah! Oh, my goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.72,0:24:47.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}非常感谢你们能来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you so much for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.02,0:24:50.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你们到场。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you for being here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.32,0:24:54.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}见到大家真是太好了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's been so great to see all y'all,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.26,0:24:57.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回想你们给我的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}rememberin' all the love and support
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.66,0:24:59.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所有的爱与支持。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that you've given me all my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.90,0:25:01.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们爱你，费丝！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We love you, Faith!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.67,0:25:03.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也爱你们！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I love you, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.67,0:25:06.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.24,0:25:09.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}there is, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.04,0:25:12.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有件事我、我必须告诉大家，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's something I-I got to tell y'all,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.11,0:25:16.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，可能会改变这一切。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}uh, that might change that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.95,0:25:19.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不该改变的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.32,0:25:21.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}见鬼，什么都不该改变，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hell, nothing should, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.79,0:25:23.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.13,0:25:34.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且，呃……好吧，事、事情是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And, uh... okay, t-the thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.74,0:25:39.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这只关乎谁拥有我的心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}this is just about who has my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.91,0:25:42.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}事实是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Truth is...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.91,0:25:44.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这里有个人我爱着……上去吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}there's someone here that I love... Just go up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.01,0:25:49.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}胜过世上任何人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}More than anyone in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.22,0:25:50.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，天哪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.85,0:25:52.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.22,0:25:53.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很抱歉打断你，费丝，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am so sorry for interrupting, Faith,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.82,0:25:55.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我想我知道你要说什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I think I know where you're going with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.79,0:25:57.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，那个，我有个问题问你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, so, I have a question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.02,0:25:59.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.99,0:26:02.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}费丝……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Faith...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.03,0:26:08.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}费丝，你愿意继续这段旅程\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Faith, will you continue this journey
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.00,0:26:10.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和我再待一周吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with me for another week?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.74,0:26:16.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我愿意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.88,0:26:22.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.11,0:26:23.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不客气。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.06,0:26:34.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我是杰。  -请留言。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-It's Jay.   -Leave a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.76,0:26:36.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰，我需要你把那段素材删了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jay, I need you to kill the footage.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.83,0:26:38.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，埋了、烧了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, bury it, burn it,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.10,0:26:40.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的销毁掉，我没开玩笑。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}physically destroy it, and I'm not kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.33,0:26:42.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吗？我来承担后果。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay? I'll take the heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.67,0:26:46.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们怎么跟奎恩说？我们没故事线了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are we gonna tell Quinn? We don't have a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.97,0:26:48.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会想办法。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.88,0:26:52.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}准备拍玛丽的视频邀请。第一条。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Standby for Mary's video invite. Take one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.14,0:26:55.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些对你来说够大吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are these gonna be big enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.35,0:26:58.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把提示卡扔了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Throw away the cue cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.28,0:26:59.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有新剧本了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've got a new script.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.02,0:27:01.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。干杯。不，不用了，谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Great. Cheers. No. No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.99,0:27:04.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，各位。玛丽的视频邀请，第一条。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, people. Mary's video invite, take one.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.39,0:27:06.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开始了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.06,0:27:07.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，你需要什么才能让人信服？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, so, what do you need to sell this?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.96,0:27:09.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想，比如窗户上的剪影\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm thinking, like, a silhouette in the window
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.76,0:27:12.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们俩在脱衣服，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}of the two of you taking your clothes off,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.96,0:27:14.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后，你知道，发出点声音。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and then just, you know, making some noises.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.00,0:27:17.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你懂的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.97,0:27:19.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，就这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, okay. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.74,0:27:21.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。我就想到这些。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. That's all I'm thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.11,0:27:22.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.38,0:27:25.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.74,0:27:27.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没问题吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you okay with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.38,0:27:29.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，嗯，应该吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, yeah. I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.12,0:27:32.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是……你知道，把节目做完，让奶奶高兴一下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's... you know, finish the show, give Gran a thrill.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.85,0:27:33.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.02,0:27:37.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，你问的是全部的事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, you're asking about all of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.36,0:27:41.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只要跟你在一起，我就没问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm good with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.99,0:27:44.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你只要给我点时间，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You just got to give me some time, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.83,0:27:46.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.98,0:28:07.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}准备好了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.32,0:28:09.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.02,0:28:14.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.19,0:28:16.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.53,0:28:22.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，不用了，谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm, no, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.07,0:28:23.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.94,0:28:27.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不喝酒，你今天还做了件完全无私的事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not drinking, and you did a totally selfless act today?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.27,0:28:30.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事。我不会告诉奎恩，我保证。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's all right. I won't tell Quinn, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.04,0:28:35.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把这事盖住感觉怪怪的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Covering it up feels weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.38,0:28:38.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}总比曝光一个还没准备好的人好，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not as weird as outing someone who's not ready yet, Rach.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.15,0:28:40.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，如果你以为我只是为了节目才这么做，我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, if you think that I wanted this just for the show, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.05,0:28:41.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不……不，不，不。嘿，不，不，不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't... no, no, no. Hey, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.35,0:28:43.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得你为Faith做了件好事，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think you did something good for Faith,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.09,0:28:45.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}总有一天她会为此感谢你的，我保证。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and she's gonna thank you for it one day. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.26,0:28:48.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.83,0:28:53.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Rachel，我得问问你。好啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rach, I got to ask you. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.10,0:28:55.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你消失那段时间发生了什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What happened while you were gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.37,0:28:56.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你到底去哪了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where'd you disappear to?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.97,0:29:00.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不……我不想听你编的Rachel式故事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't... I-I-I don't want some Rachel story.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.07,0:29:01.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要听真话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.58,0:29:06.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，好吧，我在监狱里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, well, I was in jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.98,0:29:09.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一直待在那儿？得了吧，Rachel。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The whole time? Come on, Rach.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.32,0:29:13.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.25,0:29:17.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}穿着运动裤，窝在被子里，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in my sweatpants, under the covers,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.06,0:29:19.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看烂电视，吃冰淇淋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}watching bad TV and eating ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.49,0:29:22.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个……等等……我是叫的外送。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Which... wait a second... I had it delivered.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.56,0:29:24.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.03,0:29:25.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，我没……我没出过门。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, I didn't... I didn't leave the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.50,0:29:26.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一次都没出？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.56,0:29:28.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。没有，没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.03,0:29:29.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mnh-mnh.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.17,0:29:31.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抑郁了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Depressed?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.54,0:29:36.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，我几乎动不了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I could barely move.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.04,0:29:38.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么不给我打电话，Rachel？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why didn't you call me, Rach?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.58,0:29:41.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为抑郁的人不会打电话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because depressed people don't call.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.21,0:29:45.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抑郁的人抑郁时确实不会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not depressed people when they're depressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.28,0:29:49.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这一切都是因为墨西哥吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What all of this because of Mexico?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.12,0:29:50.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有那么糟糕吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was that bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.96,0:29:52.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.09,0:29:55.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托。天哪，不是。我只是……呃，天哪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. God, no. I just... uh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.63,0:29:58.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，我不太擅长面对幸福。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't really do well, you know, with happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.36,0:30:00.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那感觉，呃……很陌生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's, uh... It's very unfamiliar.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.37,0:30:02.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.30,0:30:07.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实挺可怕的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}it's terrifying, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.07,0:30:11.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你为什么回来？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why'd you come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.51,0:30:13.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说实话？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Honestly?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.65,0:30:19.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想见你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wanted to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.55,0:30:22.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 你是你这类人里的第一个，也是最后一个 *\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* You're the first and last of your kind *
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.99,0:30:25.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 像把动物从洞里拽出来一样拽我 *\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Pull me like an animal out of a hole *
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.96,0:30:29.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 我想成为你拉动的每一根杆 *\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* I want to be every lever you pull *
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.93,0:30:32.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 还有每一场为你洒下的淋浴 *\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* And all showers that shower you *
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.56,0:30:34.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 要用爪子扒你，扒你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Gonna paw, paw at you
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.37,0:30:38.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 像猫扒我的羊毛衫 *\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Like at cat paws at my woolen jumper *
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.57,0:30:40.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 嘟-嘟-嘟，嘟，嘟-嘟-嘟-嘟\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Do-do-do, do, do-do-do-do
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.34,0:30:45.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 做你的迷你杜宾，借走帅哥的趣闻 *\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Be your Min Pin and borrower of handsome trivia *
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.48,0:30:47.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 嘿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Hey
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.05,0:30:49.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 噢，噢，噢，噢，噢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.92,0:30:50.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ahh.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.98,0:30:53.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 噢，吞了我吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Oh, devour me
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.28,0:30:56.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 噢，噢，噢，噢，噢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.22,0:31:00.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 如果你真觉得你能受得了我 *\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* If you really think that you can stomach me *
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.06,0:31:02.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我受不了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.36,0:31:05.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么？为什么？为什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why? Why? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.70,0:31:08.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我知道跟你的开始是什么样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'Cause I know how things start with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.94,0:31:11.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也知道结局是什么样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I know how they end.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.00,0:31:15.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我做不到，Rachel。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't do it, Rach.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.61,0:31:23.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我到底在这儿干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the hell am I doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.28,0:31:25.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的当事人还有最后一件证据\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My client has one last piece of evidence
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.68,0:31:27.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想呈上来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}she'd like to present.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.12,0:31:28.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我建议她别这么做，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have advised her not to,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.52,0:31:30.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但她……特别固执。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but she is... incredibly stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.47,0:31:49.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这算证据？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is evidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.38,0:31:57.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-出去。  -Chet，你确定？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Leave.   -Chet, you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.15,0:31:58.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你付我每小时700美元\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You pay me $700 an hour
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.38,0:32:00.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是为了确保你别用下半身思考。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to make sure you don't think with your dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.55,0:32:03.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}滚出去。你也滚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get out. You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.30,0:32:16.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还留着那个？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You kept that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.54,0:32:21.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}留着，你这混蛋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, you asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.61,0:32:23.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.24,0:32:27.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为那是你唯一一次说"我爱你"。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'Cause it's the only time you ever said "I love you."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.05,0:32:37.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那件事我很抱歉，孩子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry about that, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.09,0:32:39.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真的很抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.30,0:32:50.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我同意她最初的条件。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm agreeing to her original terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.77,0:32:54.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}《永恒》40%的永久所有权。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}40% ownership of "Everlasting" in perpetuity.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.51,0:32:59.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这节目是你的主意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The show was your idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.66,0:33:14.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我给你们留点时间。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll give you a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.67,0:33:25.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Adam，你只剩一条视频邀请了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Adam, you have one video invitation left.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.50,0:33:27.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}准备好了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.38,0:33:35.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个，Adam……呃，直到今天早上，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, Adam... um, up until this morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.31,0:33:37.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还以为这周我就要回家了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I thought I'd be going home this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.35,0:33:39.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想解释一下为什么我一直没有\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want to explain why I haven't been
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.55,0:33:41.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}完全坦白我自己。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}completely honest about myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.69,0:33:44.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要是不知道我是谁，怎么能选我？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How can you pick me if you don't know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.12,0:33:51.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，呃，我曾有过一段家暴婚姻。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, um, I was in an abusive marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.23,0:33:53.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道我看起来不像。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know I don't look the part.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.50,0:33:56.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他也不像，但……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Neither did he, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.67,0:34:01.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关起门来，那是……那是很残忍的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}behind closed doors, it was... it was brutal.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.34,0:34:05.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当他打断我女儿Lily Belle的胳膊时，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When he broke my daughter, Lily Belle's, arm,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.84,0:34:10.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他当然威胁我，说我说出去就杀了我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}of course he threatened to kill me if I told.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.85,0:34:13.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是认真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And he meant it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.78,0:34:15.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我还是说了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I told.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.85,0:34:18.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我告诉了警察。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I told the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.12,0:34:20.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我告诉了家人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I told my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.56,0:34:25.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为了保护我的孩子，我什么都愿意做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I would do anything to protect my baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.73,0:34:28.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想我只是想让你知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I guess I-I just want you to know
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.67,0:34:30.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就是这样的女人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that's the kind of woman I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.60,0:34:35.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，要么送我回家，好让我陪我宝贝女儿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, send me home so I can be with my sweet girl
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.34,0:34:40.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要么选我，好让你见见她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}or pick me so you can meet her.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.61,0:34:43.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我相信你会这么做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I trust that you'll do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.62,0:34:53.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Mary，你的故事让我很感动，也很敬佩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mary, your story moved and impressed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.79,0:34:56.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很想见见你女儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd love to meet your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.77,0:35:04.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Rachel？嗯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rach? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.64,0:35:07.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道Chet有时候特别强势吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know how Chet gets really pushy sometimes?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.94,0:35:09.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.51,0:35:14.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他说这集我们一点戏剧性都没有，然后……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He said we didn't have any drama in this ep, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.51,0:35:15.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.71,0:35:18.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他看了去Faith老家的那些记录。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He read the damn logs from the Faith trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.85,0:35:20.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我能怎么办？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What was I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.39,0:35:26.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这只看谁得到了我的心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is just about who has my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.52,0:35:28.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's it right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.29,0:35:29.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看吧？Chet，嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See? Chet, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.53,0:35:31.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，怪人。嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, weirdo. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.26,0:35:32.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}王子来这儿干嘛？我们只是想……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And what's the prince doing here? We just wanted to...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.76,0:35:34.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们只是……想跟你谈谈那段素材。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We just... we wanted to talk to you about the footage.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.60,0:35:36.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，我知道。那些乡巴佬女同的玩意儿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, I know. All that hillbilly lesbo stuff
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.64,0:35:37.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很精彩，是吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}is great, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.84,0:35:39.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多亏Jay发现了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And thanks to Jay for spotting that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.30,0:35:41.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Chet……我，我是说，那不是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chet... I-I-I mean, that's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.21,0:35:43.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉。等等，是……是Jay拿给你的，是吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry. Excuse me, did... Jay Jay brought it to you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.41,0:35:45.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，对。我跟他说下周我们需要个能让人议论的爆点\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, yeah. I told him we needed a water-cooler moment next week
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.71,0:35:48.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为了续订，而且，呃，这太怪了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for renewal, and, uh, this is so weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.21,0:35:49.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}又好又怪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's good, and it's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.55,0:35:51.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，倒回去……切回那个镜头\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, go back... Cut back to that shot
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.32,0:35:52.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她拿着十字架那个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}of her with the crucifix.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.95,0:35:56.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.36,0:35:58.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后……放。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And... go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.46,0:35:59.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}下周《永恒之恋》，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Next week on "Everlasting,"
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.93,0:36:02.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其中一位女士将把她整个……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}one of the ladies will put her whole...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.43,0:36:04.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，Chet，我知道这素材很棒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, Chet, I know that the footage is really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.63,0:36:05.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.46,0:36:06.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.70,0:36:07.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我以为她会在，呃……教堂舞会上出柜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I thought she was gonna come out
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.93,0:36:09.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在，呃……在教堂舞会上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}at the, uh... At the church dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.37,0:36:10.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那得多劲爆啊！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That would have been so boo-yah!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.70,0:36:11.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}同性恋太……其实，那都是两年前的事了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gay is so... actually, it's like two years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.97,0:36:13.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在流行的是跨性别。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and transgender is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.67,0:36:16.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊，他真是会迎合大众的天才，对吧？呃，你知道吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}God, he's a populist genius, isn't he? Uh, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.48,0:36:17.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们其实停掉了那个故事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We actually stopped the story
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.81,0:36:19.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为这里有更好的故事，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because there was a much better story here,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.31,0:36:19.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个更大的故事。哦，是吗？什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}a much bigger story. Oh, yeah? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.01,0:36:22.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她跟Adam做了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She lost it to Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.35,0:36:24.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。拜托。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.88,0:36:26.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她是女同，拉拉，拉拉，女同，同。拜托。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's a lesbo, lezzie, lezzie, lesbo, les. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.85,0:36:28.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Chet，你不能……那些假叫床声。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chet, you just can't... All those fake sex noises.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.72,0:36:30.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉，老板，她瞧不上你那套香肠土豆泥。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry, guv'ner, she doesn't fancy your bangers and mash.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.42,0:36:31.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，拍摄的时候已经很清楚了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, it became abundantly clear while we were shooting
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.92,0:36:32.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}曝光她会毁了她的人生，所以……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that outing her would ruin her life, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.99,0:36:34.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她是自愿签的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, she signed up for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.39,0:36:36.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，他们都是自愿签的，所以……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, they all sign up for it, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.59,0:36:38.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不能用这段素材。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can't use this footage.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.66,0:36:41.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉，你刚说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry, what did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.40,0:36:43.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不能用这段素材。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can't use the footage.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.67,0:36:45.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我跟她有过口头约定。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, I made a verbal agreement with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.67,0:36:46.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不能用。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can't use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.80,0:36:48.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就好比女佣说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, that's a little like the maid
