Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.40,0:37:11.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说实话，我……听着，这事我站你这边。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Honestly, I'm... look, I'm with you on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.50,0:37:14.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过，呃，我……听着，我有个东西你可能……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But, um, I do... look, I've got something that you might...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.53,0:37:16.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可能会更喜欢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You might enjoy even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.71,0:37:24.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听我说，对不起，好吗，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}L-look, I'm sorry, okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.51,0:37:27.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但她总有一天得出柜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but she's got to come out sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.31,0:37:29.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么，什么时候由你决定？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, what, it's up to you to decide when?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.55,0:37:31.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，Perez最近都不干这种事了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, Perez stopped doing that recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.92,0:37:34.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Rach，我们节目就像一面镜子，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rach, our show's like a mirror, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.05,0:37:35.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它帮人们面对真相。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It helps people face the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.85,0:37:38.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你刚才是在引用Wagerstein医生的话？天啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you just quote Dr. Wagerstein to me? Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.72,0:37:40.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那感觉怎么样，当那……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How did it feel when that...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.53,0:37:42.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那坨狗屎从你嘴里掉出来？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That ball of crap fell out of your mouth?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.49,0:37:44.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，感觉爽吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, it feel good?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.09,0:37:46.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Chet说他会帮我安排好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chet said he would hook me up
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.53,0:37:48.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只要我找到大料。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}if I found something big.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.33,0:37:50.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以呢，你就信了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And so, what, you fell for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.07,0:37:52.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我总得想办法离开这里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've got to find my way out of here somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.84,0:37:55.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是想提醒你，以前至少还有\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just want to remind you that there used to be
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.47,0:37:58.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么几件事你是不会做的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}at least, like, a few things that you wouldn't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.34,0:37:59.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，你也是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.48,0:38:01.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，但我们说的不是我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, but we're not talking about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.45,0:38:03.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们说的是还能救的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're talking about people we can still save.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.73,0:38:19.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，Goldberg，你跑哪去了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Goldberg, where the hell you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.90,0:38:21.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快来。走吧。进来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. Let's go. Get in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.53,0:38:23.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}《今晚好莱坞》在播下周的宣传片。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Hollywood Tonight's" airing next week's promo.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.80,0:38:25.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不用了，我不想看。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm good. I don't want in.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.14,0:38:27.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧，我觉得你会想看这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. I think you're gonna want to see this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.51,0:38:29.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.04,0:38:32.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}《今晚好莱坞》独家爆料\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Hollywood Tonight's" exclusive scoop
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.44,0:38:34.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}《永恒之恋》求爱者的性爱录像。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}on the "Everlasting" suitor's sex tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.95,0:38:38.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最新泄露的录像显示Adam Cromwell\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This newly leaked tape shows Adam Cromwell
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.08,0:38:41.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟某位王室成员的妹妹上了床。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}shagging the sister of a royal someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.12,0:38:43.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想先发制人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want to get ahead of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.55,0:38:46.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也想让我现在追求的女士们放心\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I want to reassure the women I'm currently courting
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.43,0:38:49.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是真心想抛开过去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am serious about putting my past behind me
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.09,0:38:50.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真心想找到真爱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and about finding true love.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.80,0:38:52.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想知道亚当为什么把这事直接交给切特。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wonder why Adam gave this straight to Chet.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.14,0:39:02.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，还撑得住吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Staying strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.41,0:39:04.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听说你出差那趟干得不错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Heard you did well on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.07,0:39:05.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，是啊，不错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Yeah, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.44,0:39:07.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So good.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.61,0:39:10.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨。嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.85,0:39:13.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们说所有东西都在这里面，但是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, uh, they said everything is on this, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.85,0:39:16.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会再核实一遍，谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I will double check, yeah. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.46,0:39:18.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的，你真好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really. It's very sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.66,0:39:20.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，别……别客气。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, don't... Don't mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.19,0:39:21.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}菲丝对收视率很有帮助，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Faith's great for ratings,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.56,0:39:22.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而中西部那些州\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and fly-over states
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.93,0:39:25.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}会爱死我的，所以……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}are gonna love me so...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.16,0:39:28.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}皮帕？我必须问一下，皮帕？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pippa? I have to. I have to ask. Pippa?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.97,0:39:32.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，呃，里面很多我的脸\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, well, um, it's... It's a lot of my face
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.97,0:39:34.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有很多非常模糊的部分\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and a lot of very blurry bits
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.81,0:39:36.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那可能根本不是皮帕。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that might not actually be Pippa.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.78,0:39:39.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但故事只要讲一次，他们就会抓住不放。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But tell the story once and, uh, they latch on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.61,0:39:42.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看你，克伦威尔，上手了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look at you, Cromwell, getting the hang of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.48,0:39:43.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}非常佩服。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Very impressed. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.78,0:39:45.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}菲丝现在是你要保护的雏鸟了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, Faith is your baby bird to protect now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.68,0:39:48.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得？我倒觉得她是我们的雏鸟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, you think? Well, I would say that she's our baby bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.19,0:39:49.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的吗？是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, really? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.09,0:39:54.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我能问你个奇怪的问题吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can I ask you a weird question?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.63,0:39:57.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}问吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.60,0:40:00.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们是朋友吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are we friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.83,0:40:05.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……没怎么想过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um... hadn't really thought about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.57,0:40:09.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……是吧？我想算是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh... yes? I guess we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.01,0:40:12.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也不知道这到底是怎么发生的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I don't know how in the hell this just happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.78,0:40:16.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但就在这一刻……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but in this exact moment...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.58,0:40:19.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是我唯一的朋友。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you're my only friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.59,0:40:22.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别搞砸了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's not break it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.79,0:40:24.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}搞砸挺有意思的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Breaking it's really fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.19,0:40:25.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，可也就头二十分钟吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, but for, like, the first 20 minutes, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.86,0:40:27.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行了，听我说，你该去休息了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, listen. You... you should get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.86,0:40:29.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明天有姑娘们飞过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You've got kids flying in tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.66,0:40:31.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听起来太好玩了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sounds like so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.15,0:40:51.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I-I...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.05,0:40:52.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一年后你会在哪儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where are you gonna be in a year?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.55,0:40:54.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会在写我的小说。你呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna be writing my novel. Where are you gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.65,0:40:56.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就嫁给你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll just be married to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.25,0:41:00.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，真的吗？还真敢说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, really. You don't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.77,0:41:16.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我只为今晚坚持，为今晚坚持\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* 'Cause I'm just holding on for tonight, on for tonight *
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.78,0:41:18.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太阳升起了，我狼狈不堪\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* The sun is up, I'm a mess
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.01,0:41:21.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在得逃出去，得逃离这一切\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Got to get out now, got to run from this *
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.98,0:41:25.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}羞耻来了，羞耻来了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Here comes the shame, here comes the shame *
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.92,0:41:27.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊-啊，啊-啊，啊-啊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Ah-ah, ah-ah, ah-ah
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.28,0:41:35.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一，二，三，一，二，三，喝\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* 1, 2, 3, 1, 2, 3, drink
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.03,0:41:38.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妈妈还是宝刀未老。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mama's still got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.93,0:41:42.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}婊子们小心了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bitches beware.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.73,0:41:45.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，我只为今晚坚持\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Oh, I'm just holding on for tonight *
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.60,0:41:48.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为今晚坚持，为今晚坚持\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* On for tonight, on for tonight *
